      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T00:30:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that b/306029038 has been implemented (nice solution BTW). I took another look at this and the effect on the raw directory in AOSP.\n\nWithout this it is about 383808K.\nWith 1 space it is about 393012K, or 10MB, or about 2.3% bigger.\nWith 2 spaces it is about 396960K, or 13MB, or about  3.4% bigger.\n\nBuild time is broadly similar between all of them.\n\nReadability is MUCH better when pretty printed, but 2 is no more readable than 1.\n\nI certainly think this is worth it. It makes it much easier to see how metalava is being invoked. What do you think?",
      "parentUuid": "6102bc5b_487eaec1",
